## Phase 6 (M6.1 auth hardening, ADR-040/041)
- H4 closed: unverified provider emails never auto-link OAuth accounts;
  verified links back-fill emailVerifiedAt
- DB progressive lockout, checked pre-scrypt (30s→30m cap, unit-tested);
  login returns 429 + Retry-After
- Password reset revokes ALL sessions and clears lockout; session inventory
  in settings (UA/IP/last-seen) with per-session revoke + sign-out-all-others
- OTP v2: peppered HMAC-SHA256 bound to purpose+email, dual-accept window
- Magic-link callback bounded (20/min/IP); CRON_SECRET mandatory in prod;
  Redis fixed-window limiter with loud degraded-mode fallback
- Migration 0022_auth_hardening included

## Phase 6 (M6.2 control truth pass)
- Plan grants founder-only with mandatory audited reason; role grants
  reason-prompted (server-validated)
- Audiences counted via honest joins; settings presence checks read reality;
  abuse ladder restyled; server-only guard; full §11 re-audit sign-off in
  docs/PHASE6-RE-AUDIT.md (every H + M item closed with code anchors)

## Phases 0–5
Per ROADMAP status blocks: API/provider/worker substrate, auth basis, plans +
usage enforcement, Gmail + SES transports, webhook delivery engine, domain
verification, control-plane read pages, dashboards, docs truth rewrite.

## SDKs (ADR-042)
packages/sdk-node (14 tests), sdks/python (16 tests) — one shared behavior
contract; sdks/ruby + sdks/php source-available beta; dashboard SDK hub
updated with install tabs and honest publish status.

## Verification
- pnpm -r test: 242 passed, 0 failed
- dashboard production build: clean
- sdks/python: 16 passed

## Post-merge ledger (tracked separately, not in this PR)
